{"steam_appid":3361510,"steam_name":"Coal LLC","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3361510/1627193292/b3ab921a7efd4973f66239cd250c0e8d8ae2ed85/1755090097/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755098355","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257182623/45ed9682e2ef6702679a46c76a09c44cf06c22f2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755098355","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/b4067495d7d27dcca58a5e2302d3b603e17b8106/ss_b4067495d7d27dcca58a5e2302d3b603e17b8106.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776327387","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/e888d4b80e762fe681aed7d24318e88238d92acb/ss_e888d4b80e762fe681aed7d24318e88238d92acb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776327387","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/ccd46dd557cd74d269b39880eed86215df5d4d90/ss_ccd46dd557cd74d269b39880eed86215df5d4d90.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776327387","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/6273b69e131ad0b10185d1f644857280feb8bc37/ss_6273b69e131ad0b10185d1f644857280feb8bc37.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776327387","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/0c2459a9087ce13df5d426196a0803f273e5e331/ss_0c2459a9087ce13df5d426196a0803f273e5e331.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776327387"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/adc66ddd351718bde4b0f054c15fe496.poster.avif?t=1776327387\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/adc66ddd351718bde4b0f054c15fe496.webm?t=1776327387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/adc66ddd351718bde4b0f054c15fe496.mp4?t=1776327387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Coal LLC, your friendly-everyday-evil-coal-mining-corporation. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With only a shoddy pickaxe to start, you must hire and promote employees, upgrade equipment and dig deep below the earth to fill your coal quota each day. Or else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/b2006937c79e46504300df0439480d2f.poster.avif?t=1776327387\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/b2006937c79e46504300df0439480d2f.webm?t=1776327387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/b2006937c79e46504300df0439480d2f.mp4?t=1776327387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feed the factories.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The underground world magically refreshes each day, so you must race to mine as much of it and as deeply as you can before nightfall. Using some very exciting and <i>hyper-realistic</i> methods for doing so. Your world might deteriorate as you grow, however.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/499d1003e83fc8dd6215ba22c47362f0.poster.avif?t=1776327387\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/499d1003e83fc8dd6215ba22c47362f0.webm?t=1776327387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/499d1003e83fc8dd6215ba22c47362f0.mp4?t=1776327387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hire BILLIONS  of employees.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You heard that right. Hire and promote employees into specialised roles in your organisation, each type having exciting and game-changing bonuses and equipment. Grow your organisation into hundreds, thousands, millions and even <strong><i>billions </i></strong>of miners willing to go out and bring back coal for the cause.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/0fbf32e6caf489dc9c8262019020bb67.poster.avif?t=1776327387\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/0fbf32e6caf489dc9c8262019020bb67.webm?t=1776327387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/0fbf32e6caf489dc9c8262019020bb67.mp4?t=1776327387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don't be afraid of the consequences.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many different maps, professions and tools means endless ways of growing your operation.  Do you have what it takes to grow the greatest coal mining corporation of all time?</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> GeForce GTX 1060 or higher</li></ul>","genres":["Indie","Simulation","Strategy"],"developers":["Bye Bye Ocean"],"publishers":["Bye Bye Ocean"],"release_date":"11 Sep, 2025"}